{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object not found, then scan area. If object visible, move or take object. Check object properties. Do task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = FindObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = DoTask    />",
